OL,3,ATrump's plans for massive arch move
OL,4,Aahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's plans for
OL,7,Fbuilding a massive arch appear to be
OL,8,Fmoving ahead, after a federal advisory
OL,9,Fcouncil terminated talks on how to
OL,10,Fhandle the 250-foot structure's
OL,11,Fpossible effects on nearby historic
OL,12,Fsites.
OL,14,FThe council, led by Trump appointees,
OL,15,Fannounced on Thursday it was ending
OL,16,Frequired consultations on the project,
OL,17,Fsaying historic preservation officers
OL,18,Ffrom Washington and Virginia had
OL,19,Frefused to sign off on harm-mitigation
OL,20,Fplans.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
