OL,3,ATrump's plans for massive arch move
OL,4,Aahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction was already expected to
OL,7,Fbegin this month, but opposition has
OL,8,Fbeen growing.
OL,10,FOn Friday, Democratic Senator Tammy
OL,11,FDuckworth blasted plans to use the arch
OL,12,Ffor defence as "foolhardy" and called
OL,13,Fit "yet another Trump vanity project".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
